# Hidden-layer test, Amazon data

Run on 2026-11-22 with 11025 test people. For each layer a test person has, that whole layer is hidden. A method sees everything else they saved, ranks every item of the hidden layer, and we check where their hidden saves land. Numbers are NDCG@10, higher is better.

```
amazon: 110247 people (88197 train, 11025 val, 11025 test)
  music    7151 items (+10000 search only),   189 tags,   426959 saves by  46859 people, 9.1 each
  film    21181 items (+10000 search only),    23 tags,  1018662 saves by  94832 people, 10.7 each
  style   22016 items (+10000 search only),  2645 tags,   687741 saves by  89009 people, 7.7 each
  layers per person: film+style 63388, music+film 21238, music+style 15415, music+film+style 10206
```

## Predicting music (CDs & Vinyl)

| given | cases | Popularity | Item-kNN across layers | No graph (hops = 0) | Tags only (no item vectors) | Multi-layer GCN (ours) |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| film | 2123 | 0.0522 | 0.0467 | 0.0807 | 0.0808 | 0.0876 |
| style | 1511 | 0.0384 | 0.0063 | 0.0459 | 0.0499 | 0.0485 |
| film + style | 1038 | 0.0462 | 0.0364 | 0.0645 | 0.0619 | 0.0697 |
| **all** | 4672 | 0.0464 | 0.0314 | 0.0658 | 0.0666 | 0.0710 |

Recall@10 over all cases: Popularity 0.0485, Item-kNN across layers 0.0320, No graph (hops = 0) 0.0680, Tags only (no item vectors) 0.0687, Multi-layer GCN (ours) 0.0733.

Paired check of Multi-layer GCN (ours) on the same cases, NDCG@10 difference with a 95% interval:

* vs Popularity, +0.0246 (+0.0214 to +0.0277)
* vs Item-kNN across layers, +0.0396 (+0.0361 to +0.0432)
* vs No graph (hops = 0), +0.0051 (+0.0032 to +0.0071)
* vs Tags only (no item vectors), +0.0043 (+0.0025 to +0.0062)

